        "content": "## PRQA 02 · PR Context Collector\nReads PR metadata, changed files and the unified diff from the GitHub API base handed over by the worker (`endpoints.github_api_base`: **mock** in review-only, real only in live mode), then asks the worker to build the sanitized, redacted, size-limited context package (`POST /context/build`). PR text is labelled UNTRUSTED.",
